Alias templates named __remove_cv / __remove_reference (libstdc++ <= 12) are
ordinary identifiers: the builtin reading needs a following '('.  Reference
compilers: g++ 11, clang 18 (-Wkeyword-compat).  Sibling
cpp11_revertible_builtin_remove_cv covers the builtin reading.
